L000463	 The odd and even gaps $\Delta_o$ and $\Delta_e$ obtained via the PQMC algorithm are represented by the solid triangles and squares, respectively. The corresponding results obtained through the Jordan-Wigner (JW) transformation are represented by hollow symbols connected by a continuous line.
L000464	}
L000465	\label{figSM1}
L000466	\end{figure}
