L000502	Disorder average $[\eta]$ of the inverse (odd) gap $\eta=1/\Delta$ as a function of the number of spins $N$ for the quantum SK model at the spin-glass quantum phase transition. The red line represents the power-law scaling $[\eta]\propto N^{1/3}$.
